# examples/games/09_after_school, played: the title, into town, Aki at the
# café, the flyer by the east trees, Mika at the school gate -- asked to the
# festival -- and home, to the festival ending.
#
# The arrows walk, E talks, Enter goes on through a line (a first press shows
# all of it, a second goes on). See tests/e2e/script.h for the grammar.

# The title's panel appears for 0.25 s: the shot waits.
24 shot title
25 expect scene TitleScene
# The languages lang.tsv has, under the menu: Español, and back to English.
26 click 463 268
40 shot title_es
41 click 334 268
# New afternoon still has the focus.
43 tap KEY_ENTER
43 expect scene TownScene
60 shot town
# Up the school path to the crossing, then west to the café.
61 press KEY_UP
230 release KEY_UP
231 press KEY_LEFT
420 release KEY_LEFT
431 tap KEY_E
470 shot aki
# Aki's two lines: a press shows all of a line, the next goes on.
475 tap KEY_ENTER
480 tap KEY_ENTER
500 tap KEY_ENTER
505 tap KEY_ENTER
# East along the street, down past the plaza, and east to the flyer.
521 press KEY_RIGHT
806 release KEY_RIGHT
807 press KEY_DOWN
960 release KEY_DOWN
961 press KEY_RIGHT
1071 release KEY_RIGHT
1080 shot flyer
# Back the way it came, and up to Mika at the school gate.
1081 press KEY_LEFT
1191 release KEY_LEFT
1192 press KEY_UP
1345 release KEY_UP
1346 press KEY_LEFT
1469 release KEY_LEFT
1470 press KEY_UP
1484 release KEY_UP
1491 tap KEY_E
1530 tap KEY_ENTER
1535 tap KEY_ENTER
1555 tap KEY_ENTER
1560 tap KEY_ENTER
1580 shot ask
# The festival, asked: the first choice, then her answer.
1581 tap KEY_ENTER
1610 tap KEY_ENTER
1615 tap KEY_ENTER
# Home, down the school path, to the evening.
1631 press KEY_RIGHT
1665 release KEY_RIGHT
1666 press KEY_DOWN
1886 release KEY_DOWN
1920 shot home
1925 tap KEY_ENTER
1926 expect scene EndScene
1990 shot ending
# Back to the title has the focus.
1991 tap KEY_ENTER
1992 expect scene TitleScene
2020 shot title_again
2021 end
